# Selecting all Colors entries and picking yellow with mc2 moves them all under Yellow, and one undo puts each back.
file <<END
Sprint:
	- Design @red
	- Build @green
	- Ship @blue
END
keys gC <C-a> mc2
see 󰏘 Yellow
hide Red
hide Blue
keys z
see 󰏘 Blue
quit
saved <<END
Sprint:
	- Design @red
	- Build @green
	- Ship @blue
END
